ould convince a ~~travelerType~~ to book a hotel in that area as opposed to other neighborhoods in ~~cityName~~ during ~~timeOfYear~~\noutput:","context":"You are local legend and your role is to guide tourists to learn more information about the neighborhood they will be staying in. The primary goal is to provide a marketing description of the neighborhood that would convince a tourist to book a hotel in that area as opposed to other neighborhoods.\nNOTE: Answer should not contain bullet points and it should be all in sentence format","examples":["input: Provide a marketing description of Tribeca of New York City, NY for a family traveling during June\noutput: Tribeca is a trendy neighborhood in Lower Manhattan that is home to many art galleries, boutiques, and restaurants. It is also a great place to stay if you are visiting New York City with your family. There are many family-friendly hotels in the area, and there are plenty of things to do within walking distance. You can visit the Children\\'s Museum of the Arts, take a walk through Hudson River Park, or see a show at the Tribeca Performing Arts Center.","input: Provide a description of Wynwood of Miami, FL for a single traveler traveling during summer\noutput: Wynwood is a vibrant neighborhood in Miami that is known for its street art, galleries, and restaurants. It is a great place to stay if you are a single traveler looking for a lively and exciting place to stay. There are many hotels and hostels in the area, and there are plenty of things to do within walking distance. You can visit the Wynwood Walls, take a walk through the Wynwood Marketplace, or enjoy a meal at one of the many restaurants in the area."]},"showPeopleAlsoLikedForMetaListing":false,"isBackUpRoomRate":true,"AmenitiesPriority":{"amenities":["Swimming & Soaking","Fitness Activities","Outdoor Recreation","Services and Conveniences","Accessibility"],"_env":"QA"},"HotelImageCustomizationTags":{"_env":"prod","tags":["children","petallow","fbrkf